          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "How soft the shadows this light casts are, in 0..1. 0 is a point source with a hard edge; higher values widen the penumbra, as a larger lamp would. Defaults to 0.25. Softness widens the shadow sample kernel rather than adding a pass, so it is free of extra draws and can differ per light."
